                            <comment id="494496" author="adilger" created="Wed, 13 May 2026 22:51:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;It looks pretty clear that the &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18938&quot; title=&quot;lu object free eats so much time&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-18938&quot;&gt;LU-18938&lt;/a&gt; patch is doing this incorrectly.  Instead of calling &lt;tt&gt;check_and_cleanup_lustre&lt;/tt&gt; (which &quot;ends&quot; the test session) it should just be using &lt;tt&gt;cleanupall&lt;/tt&gt; or similar directly.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
